00:02:48.240 --> 00:02:50.510
We'll get familiar with
a handy tool, Postman,

00:02:50.510 --> 00:02:53.942
which provides a nice way to
interact with web-based APIs.

00:02:53.942 --> 00:02:56.580
We'll use that tool to
