01:32:55.810 --> 01:32:58.620
helps to unlock another
REST API constraint

01:32:58.620 --> 01:33:01.670
scavenger hunt item, and
that is uniform design.

01:33:01.670 --> 01:33:04.070
Now this constraint has four sub sections,

01:33:04.070 --> 01:33:06.110
one of which is what we just discussed.

01:33:06.110 --> 01:33:08.764
Resource manipulation
through representations,

01:33:08.764 --> 01:33:11.320
because there was enough
information included,

