it was clear how to modify,

01:33:13.110 --> 01:33:14.460
and delete this resource.

01:33:14.460 --> 01:33:15.890
Another sub section in here is

01:33:15.890 --> 01:33:18.380
resource identification in requests.

01:33:18.380 --> 01:33:20.320
Those are the URLs that are included,

01:33:20.320 --> 01:33:22.040
because of the URIs are included,

01:33:22.040 --> 01:33:23.340
we know that we can get,

01:33:23.340 --> 01:33:25.460
and manipulate specific resources.

01:33:25.460 --> 01:33:29.330
Uniform use of the HTTP
verbs is pretty powerful.

